<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Brambles 1995/96 net profit soars.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Brambles 1995/96 net profit soars.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    331.7 vs 295.31</p>
<p>    Net profit			    215.1 vs 97.66</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     35.0 vs 33.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Brambles Industries Ltd is a transport, logistics and security group.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	   69.0  vs  65.0</p>
<p>    Sales (billion)		     2.97 vs   3.03</p>
<p>    Other income			194.6  vs 153.7</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			  97.7  vs  44.7</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		loss 15.1  vs loss 112.3</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 pct franked</p>
<p>Pay date Oct 31</p>
<p>Reg date Oct 17</p>
<p>    Tax				    111.5  vs 103.1</p>
<p>    Interest				67.9  vs  62.2</p>
<p>    Depreciation			 325.8  vs 326.9</p>
<p>    Minorities			     5.4  vs   6.7</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
